  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Kiran Kumar Reddy Gunturu vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 31 July, 2024 Aphc010312972024 In The High Court Of Andhra Pradesh AT AMARAVATI [3331] (Special Original Jurisdiction) WEDNESDAY ,THE THIRTY FIRST DAY OF JULY TWO THOUSAND AND TWENTY FOUR PRESENT THE HONOURABLE SRI JUSTICE SUBBA REDDY SATTI WRIT PETITION NO: 15929/2024 Between: Kiran Kumar Reddy Gunturu ...PETITIONER AND The State Of Andhra Pradesh and Others ...RESPONDENT(S) Counsel for the Petitioner: 1. THANDAVA YOGESH Counsel for the Respondent(S): 1. GP FOR SERVICES IV",
    "facts": "The petitioner applied to the post of Food Safety Officer pursuant to the Notification No.11 of 2022 dated 26.09.2022. Petitioner was invited for certificate verification and he attended for verification of certificates on 21.12.2023 and submitted all the relevant documents. In final selection, the petitioner's Hall Ticket was not shown and replaced another hall ticket number.",
    "arguments": "He would also submit that the authorities are not treated the MDS Degree as Degree in Kiran Kumar Reddy Gunturu vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 31 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/131467725/ 1 Medicine."
  },
